Description:
    TxDb.Gmax.JGI.Gmv4 provides transcript, exon, and CDS annotations
    for soybean (Glycine max Wm82.a4.v1). The TxDb was generated from the
    JGI/Phytozome GFF3 annotation and is distributed through AnnotationHub.
    Use get_gmax_txdb() to retrieve the database and GenomicFeatures
    accessors such as genes(), transcripts(), exonsBy(), and cdsBy() to
    query gene models identified by JGI/Phytozome locus IDs.
